{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22032","main_id":22032,"main_title":"家乡之味","main_description":"来自璃月的学者汤雯似乎饱受思乡之情的困扰…","chapter_title":"家乡之味","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2203201,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2203201,"sequence":13,"variant":0,"line_id":220320106,"next_line_ids":[220320107],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3022,"speaker_text_hash":727626069,"speaker":"汤雯","speaker_raw":"汤雯","text_hash":1261001394,"text":"先自我介绍一下，我叫汤雯，是来自璃月的历史学者，之前正在实地调研稻妻的特色风俗与民话。","raw_text":"先自我介绍一下，我叫汤雯，是来自璃月的历史学者，之前正在实地调研稻妻的特色风俗与民话。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2203201.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22032","main_id":22032,"main_title":"家乡之味","main_description":"来自璃月的学者汤雯似乎饱受思乡之情的困扰…","chapter_title":"家乡之味","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2203201,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2203201,"sequence":14,"variant":0,"line_id":220320107,"next_line_ids":[220320108],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3022,"speaker_text_hash":727626069,"speaker":"汤雯","speaker_raw":"汤雯","text_hash":2102026106,"text":"本来资料已经搜集的差不多了，正准备返回璃月。但是因为稻妻的锁国令结被迫滞留在这里，已经有一段时间了…","raw_text":"本来资料已经搜集的差不多了，正准备返回璃月。但是因为稻妻的锁国令结被迫滞留在这里，已经有一段时间了…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2203201.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22032","main_id":22032,"main_title":"家乡之味","main_description":"来自璃月的学者汤雯似乎饱受思乡之情的困扰…","chapter_title":"家乡之味","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2203201,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2203201,"sequence":15,"variant":0,"line_id":220320108,"next_line_ids":[220320109],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3022,"speaker_text_hash":727626069,"speaker":"汤雯","speaker_raw":"汤雯","text_hash":905967322,"text":"其实，我觉得这对我来说也算是好事。因为我感觉，此刻的稻妻正处于一个历史性的时刻！","raw_text":"其实，我觉得这对我来说也算是好事。因为我感觉，此刻的稻妻正处于一个历史性的时刻！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2203201.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22032","main_id":22032,"main_title":"家乡之味","main_description":"来自璃月的学者汤雯似乎饱受思乡之情的困扰…","chapter_title":"家乡之味","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2203201,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2203201,"sequence":16,"variant":0,"line_id":220320109,"next_line_ids":[220320110],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3022,"speaker_text_hash":727626069,"speaker":"汤雯","speaker_raw":"汤雯","text_hash":2275683130,"text":"我很确信，这段特殊的时期，必然会在提瓦特的史册上留下浓墨重彩的一笔。","raw_text":"我很确信，这段特殊的时期，必然会在提瓦特的史册上留下浓墨重彩的一笔。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2203201.json"}
